365
00:30:24,083 --> 00:30:25,500
<i>¿Entiendes?</i>

366
00:30:32,333 --> 00:30:34,125
<i>Reconocimiento, Control Maestro.</i>

367
00:30:34,958 --> 00:30:35,958
