439
00:33:28,750 --> 00:33:30,125
<i>Oh, lo aplastaste.</i>

440
00:33:32,833 --> 00:33:35,250
No.

441
00:33:39,375 --> 00:33:44,792
<i>♪ Feliz cumpleaños a ti
Feliz cumpleaños a ti ♪</i>

442
00:33:48,708 --> 00:33:51,207
<i>♪ Feliz cumpleaños, querida Tess ♪</i>

443
00:33:51,208 --> 00:33:54,457
<i>♪ Feliz cumpleaños a ti ♪</i>

